{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/962335cc2bc103cf64f52e3ca9f902a8.webp?t=1757941557\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you press a key or click the mouse, you\u2019ll hit a drum! Boom-boom-tap! Add rhythm to your daily work \u2014 maybe this is the legendary... cyber mechanical keyboard?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard: Hits the center of the drum. Boom boom boom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse: Taps the edge of the drum. Tap tap tap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/ebff65e65bb1820d03da4cc27f473464.poster.avif?t=1757941557\" width=620 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/ebff65e65bb1820d03da4cc27f473464.webm?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/ebff65e65bb1820d03da4cc27f473464.mp4?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each beat generates a musical energy note \u2014 the more notes you collect, the faster your animal friends will run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, the busier you are, the faster your companions run with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/21cec6f787a41c12ba272303ce0cc84a.poster.avif?t=1757941557\" width=620 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/21cec6f787a41c12ba272303ce0cc84a.webm?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/21cec6f787a41c12ba272303ce0cc84a.mp4?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/a86850a593095a408a944621e3fb6fd3.webp?t=1757941557\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they run, your animals will receive rewards delivered by a chubby pigeon \u2014 hats, glasses, tops, shoes... and maybe more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/4382a74a7a842a782ab492d786fc71a2.poster.avif?t=1757941557\" width=620 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/4382a74a7a842a782ab492d786fc71a2.webm?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/4382a74a7a842a782ab492d786fc71a2.mp4?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every accessory comes with custom hand-drawn animations for each animal. Try collecting all kinds and mixing styles to hit the road in style! The demo currently includes 40 unique items to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/7406b0f42702f8109a1adcfde02b99b6.poster.avif?t=1757941557\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/7406b0f42702f8109a1adcfde02b99b6.webm?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/7406b0f42702f8109a1adcfde02b99b6.mp4?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/2d0f1b25174264668d035b33b61f8642.webp?t=1757941557\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve turned famous cities around the world into hand-drawn pixel multi-layered side-scrolling maps, each featuring iconic architecture and landmarks. When you finish running a full marathon (42,195m) in a city, you'll unlock the next! The demo currently includes two cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/afd4c7dd4ed01d5e2f9c3a5ce0b7defb.poster.avif?t=1757941557\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/afd4c7dd4ed01d5e2f9c3a5ce0b7defb.webm?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/afd4c7dd4ed01d5e2f9c3a5ce0b7defb.mp4?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/de7afcccccd767b1accf749fcdc05fe8.webp?t=1757941557\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely drag the game window around your desktop, or hide the background with one click \u2014 perfect seamless blending with your workspace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/9992f15b6c8b74668499c18dbdc7907c.poster.avif?t=1757941557\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/9992f15b6c8b74668499c18dbdc7907c.webm?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/9992f15b6c8b74668499c18dbdc7907c.mp4?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resize the window however you like \u2014 go full screen or shrink it down to just 200\u00d7128 pixels. No one will ever notice you're secretly playing\\~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/2165b1273101d9bfe733728857f823f7.poster.avif?t=1757941557\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/2165b1273101d9bfe733728857f823f7.webm?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/2165b1273101d9bfe733728857f823f7.mp4?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947470?t=1757941557","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/87ddb9c6fa4731fb15081ba8827c9555799ac315/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757941557","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/af9759a11c665099ddc5b556fec52d558b54986e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757941557","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/af9759a11c665099ddc5b556fec52d558b54986e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757941557","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/962335cc2bc103cf64f52e3ca9f902a8.webp?t=1757941557\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you press a key or click the mouse, you\u2019ll hit a drum! Boom-boom-tap! Add rhythm to your daily work \u2014 maybe this is the legendary... cyber mechanical keyboard?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard: Hits the center of the drum. Boom boom boom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse: Taps the edge of the drum. Tap tap tap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/ebff65e65bb1820d03da4cc27f473464.poster.avif?t=1757941557\" width=620 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/ebff65e65bb1820d03da4cc27f473464.webm?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/ebff65e65bb1820d03da4cc27f473464.mp4?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each beat generates a musical energy note \u2014 the more notes you collect, the faster your animal friends will run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, the busier you are, the faster your companions run with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted