?t=1757941557\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely drag the game window around your desktop, or hide the background with one click \u2014 perfect seamless blending with your workspace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/9992f15b6c8b74668499c18dbdc7907c.poster.avif?t=1757941557\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/9992f15b6c8b74668499c18dbdc7907c.webm?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/9992f15b6c8b74668499c18dbdc7907c.mp4?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resize the window however you like \u2014 go full screen or shrink it down to just 200\u00d7128 pixels. No one will ever notice you're secretly playing\\~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/2165b1273101d9bfe733728857f823f7.poster.avif?t=1757941557\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/2165b1273101d9bfe733728857f823f7.webm?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/2165b1273101d9bfe733728857f823f7.mp4?t=1757941557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["mindora games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/457e6e3639859dc4c84862d3226ea5b64d55ad7f/header.jpg?t=1757941557","is_free":false,"l